    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, but i've already talked to my doctor and they didn't really say much about the herbal side of things. i'm just worried about the side effects of the pill and i'd rather just use the supplement if it's safe. like, is it actually a big deal or is it just one of those things they always warn you about just in case?",
