      "content": "I understand your concern about managing your health naturally. While your doctor did not provide a definitive answer, it's important to note that even medications designed to be safe can have interactions with supplements like St John's wort. These interactions vary greatly between individuals and can have unpredictable outcomes. Seeking a second opinion or a consultation from a pharmacist could help address these specific worries and guide you towards making an informed decision. Your health and safety should always come first.",
