    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just trying to avoid being poked and prodded by doctors if i don't have to. honestly, i've read online that st johns wort is pretty mild since it's just a plant. do you think the interaction is actually a real risk like it'll stop the pill from working completely, or is it just a minor thing i shouldn't worry too much about? i really want to just start taking it tonight.",
